#####################################################################################
# Mouse bed, full model: the rat bed of coil3_bed (from the 511 keV mu-map of the Quad86 coil with
# the rat cradle) with its cross-section scaled by 0.48707 in x and y, so that the outer edge of
# the cradle is at r = 17 mm. z is not scaled. Bed only, no coil: it fits inside the Quad35 coil,
# whose inner wall starts at r = 17.5 mm.
#   mouse_bed_all.mac  : every part (246 volumes)                    -> visualisation
#   mouse_bed_bore.mac : the cradle in its parent mouseCradle (52 volumes) -> acquisitions
# To use it in another macro, copy the folder mouse_bed/ next to the macro and, where the bed is
# defined, execute one of the two files.
# The cradle is ONE block: to move it, change only the translation of mouseCradle below, or repeat the
# command with your values after executing this file, e.g.  /gate/mouseCradle/placement/setTranslation 0 0 25 mm
# Limits: |dz| <= 77.25 mm keeps the axial FOV filled with cradle (whole bore up to 69.75 mm), so a
# sensitivity scan can move it +-75 mm with the source; sideways only 0.30 mm before the parent
# reaches the Quad35 coil (r 17.5 mm). The NECR mouse phantom (r 12.5 mm, 4.5 mm above the axis)
# clears the cradle by 1.71 mm and the parent by 0.09 mm.
# The cut run models in the test folders use a changed mouse cradle: solid side walls about 3 mm
# thick and polyethylene (HDPE) as material (see full_coil_models/README.md).
#####################################################################################

/gate/geometry/setMaterialDatabase mouse_bed/MouseBed.db

# parent of the cradle: air half-shell below the axis (y <= 0)
/gate/world/daughters/name mouseCradle
/gate/world/daughters/insert cylinder
/gate/mouseCradle/setMaterial Air
/gate/mouseCradle/geometry/setRmin 11.75 mm
/gate/mouseCradle/geometry/setRmax 17.20 mm
/gate/mouseCradle/geometry/setHeight 304.5 mm
/gate/mouseCradle/geometry/setPhiStart 180 deg
/gate/mouseCradle/geometry/setDeltaPhi 180 deg
/gate/mouseCradle/placement/setTranslation 0 0 0 mm
/gate/mouseCradle/vis/setVisible 0

/control/execute mouse_bed/mouse_bed_parts_bore.mac
/control/execute mouse_bed/mouse_bed_parts_outside.mac
